     <table style="border: none;border-collapse: collapse;margin-bottom: .001pt;"><tbody><tr class="firstRow"><td style="border-bottom: solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt;border-left: none;border-right: none;border-top: none;padding-bottom: 0;padding-left: 5.4pt;padding-right: 5.4pt;padding-top: 0;vertical-align: middle;width: 415.3pt;"><p style="font-family: ˎ̥;font-size: 13.5pt;line-height: 150.0%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;"><span style="font-family: ˎ̥;font-size: 13.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>202</strong></span><span style="font-family: ˎ̥;font-size: 13.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>1</strong></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 13.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>年绍兴一中消防应急疏散演练方案</strong></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom: none;border-left: none;border-right: none;border-top: none;padding-bottom: 0;padding-left: 5.4pt;padding-right: 5.4pt;padding-top: 0;vertical-align: middle;width: 415.3pt;"><p style="font-family: ˎ̥;font-size: 10pt;line-height: 150.0%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 10pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong> </strong></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom: none;border-left: none;border-right: none;border-top: none;padding-bottom: 0;padding-left: 5.4pt;padding-right: 5.4pt;padding-top: 0;vertical-align: top;width: 415.3pt;"><p>
</p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom: none;border-left: none;border-right: none;border-top: none;padding-bottom: 0;padding-left: 5.4pt;padding-right: 5.4pt;padding-top: 0;vertical-align: middle;width: 15.3pt;"><p style="font-family: ˎ̥;font-size: 10pt;line-height: 150.0%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;"><span style="font-size: 10pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 20.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;text-indent: 0.42in;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">为贯彻公安部颁布执行的《机关、团体、企业、事业单位消防安全管理规定》（公安部第61号令），切实做好校园内的</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">消防（防火）</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">安全工作，确保学校一旦发生火情时，做到反应迅速、分工明确、处置有序、及时扑灭，努力使人员伤亡和财产损失减小到最低限度，特组织此次消防应急疏散演练。</span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 20.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0.29in;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">一、组织领导</span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 20.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0.29in;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">总指挥：</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">孙洪亮</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 20.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0.29in;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">副总指挥：沈祥土、</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">何隽豪、</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">林萍华、</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">吴丽娟、</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">王月琴、钟慧军  </span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 20.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0.29in;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">楼层疏散负责人：孟德超、</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">吴丽娟</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">、</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">王斌</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">、</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">郑祥霖</span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 20.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0.29in;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">集合场地负责人：何隽豪</span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 20.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0.29in;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">道路疏散负责人:</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">王宁</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">、</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">朱亚烨</span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 20.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0.29in;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">警报、广播、电子屏：朱玛莉、张帆、祝建强、吕斌</span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 20.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0.29in;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">摄影：舒凤</span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 20.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0.29in;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">医</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">务</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">：范国娟</span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 20.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0.29in;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">宿舍管理老师：</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">王青、聂云、</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">王瑾</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">、</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">单兴妹、任方芳、</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">章晓菁</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 20.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0.29in;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">二、 组织分工</span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 20.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;text-indent: 0.25in;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">朱玛莉、张帆：警报声发出、学校篮球场扩音设备、报告厅话筒投影仪等设备准备。</span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 20.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">任方芳</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">和</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">聂云</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">：检查、清理消防通道，演练前打开消防通道大门，演练中检查</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>利楼</strong></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">宿舍内有无人员滞留。</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">任方芳</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">疏散引导</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>利楼</strong></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">东侧，</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">聂云</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">疏散引导</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>利楼</strong></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">西侧。</span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 20.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">孟德超在</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>利楼西侧出口</strong></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">引导学生到集合场地，</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">吴丽娟</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">在</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>利楼东侧出口</strong></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">引导学生到集合场地。</span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 20.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">王瑾</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">和</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">单兴妹</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">：检查、清理消防通道，演练前打开消防通道大门，演练中检查</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>贞楼</strong></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">宿舍内有无人员滞留。</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">王瑾</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">疏散引导</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>贞楼</strong></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">东侧，</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">单兴妹</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">疏散引导</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>贞楼</strong></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">西侧。</span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 20.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">王斌</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">在</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>贞楼西侧出口</strong></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">引导学生到集合场地，</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">郑祥霖</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">在</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>贞楼东侧出口</strong></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">引导学生到集合场地</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">。   </span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 20.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0.29in;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;text-indent: -0.29in;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">    </span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">章晓菁</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">：在</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>利楼、贞楼</strong></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">学生公寓</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">大厅</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">东门出口处维护秩序和疏散引导</span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 20.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0.30in;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">王青</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">: 在</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>利楼、贞楼</strong></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">学生公寓西门</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">大厅</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">出口处维护秩序和疏散引导。</span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 20.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;text-indent: 0.67in;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">演练前林萍华老师将当天实际住校生人数报</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">何隽豪</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">老师。</span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 20.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">   王月琴：负责高</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">二</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">疏散学生整队（按照升旗仪式队形，高二在中间位置），并清点人数后报何隽豪老师。</span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 20.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">  </span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">钟慧军：负责高</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">一</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">疏散学生整队（按照升旗仪式队形，高一在球场最南侧），并清点人数后报</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">何隽豪</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">老师。</span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 20.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0.29in;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;text-indent: -0.04in;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">陈锋、吕斌：国旗前搭台（两套课桌椅）、寝室电源控制</span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 20.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0.29in;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;text-indent: -0.04in;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">祝建强：报告厅电子屏，利楼、贞楼消防信号控制，确保演练时通道畅通，演练结束后关闭。</span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 20.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0.29in;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;text-indent: -0.04in;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">舒凤：摄影</span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 20.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;text-indent: 0.25in;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">范国娟：负责医</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">务</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">保障</span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 20.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0.29in;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">三、演练时间、集合地点及参加学生</span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 20.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0.29in;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">时间：20</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">2</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">1</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">年 1</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">0</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">月 </span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">27</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">日(星期</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">三</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">)晚上1</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">7</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">:</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">5</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">0</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，演练结束后回教室自修</span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 20.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0.29in;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">地点：学校篮球场</span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 20.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0.29in;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">参加学生：高一、高二全体住校生</span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 20.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">四、情景模拟</span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 20.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">1．高一、高二全体住校学生均在宿舍。</span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 20.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">2．紧急应对情况：宿舍内起火的紧急疏散。</span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 20.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">3．演练前做好的准备：由越城消防支队警官在报告厅作一消防安全知识及火场逃生的知识讲座，由安全处</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">沈祥土</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">主任讲清演练过程、疏散线路及注意事项。</span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 20.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">4．发现寝室起火，警报声发出，总务部门切断电源，并检查应急灯是否正常点亮，林萍华老师拨打119。</span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 20.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">5、学生按设定出口和线路迅速撤离宿舍楼，到学校篮球场集中。</span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 20.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">6、清点安全撤离到集合场地的学生人数，检查有无人员缺少。</span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 20.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">五、演练要注意的事项</span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 20.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">   1．听到警报声后，全体学生必须快速、有序、安全地进行疏散，不准在寝室内滞留，也不要收拾物品下楼。即使确定本宿舍人员己经撤离，也不要关门。</span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 20.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">2．发生火灾时公寓管理人员应该立即切断电源，学校采取应急措施方案，组织人员疏散，撤离现场。撤离时应先保证火源发生点和建筑上层的人员先撤离。</span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 20.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">3．公寓楼发生紧急情况疏散时，生活指导老师要教育学生首先要冷静，稳定学生情绪，有序地组织学生呈两列队伍从东西两个楼梯下楼。并要求站在楼梯口旁边指挥学生撤离，杜绝拥挤踩踏事故，直至最后一名学生离开后才能离开，离开前还要检查所负责楼层是否有人。</span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 20.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">4．疏散过程中要求学生用湿毛巾捂住口鼻，低姿弯腰前行。严禁出现拥挤、推攘现象，防止意外事故的发生。</span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 20.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">5．学生撤离公寓后，服从学校工作人员的统一指挥安排，到学校篮球场集中。</span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 20.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">六、演练安排  </span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 20.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><table style="border: none;border-collapse: collapse;margin-bottom: .001pt;"><tbody><tr style="height: 0.27in;" class="firstRow"><td style="background: white;border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-left: solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding-bottom: 0;padding-left: 5.4pt;padding-right: 5.4pt;padding-top: 0;vertical-align: middle;width: 37.75pt;"><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 20.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> 时间</span></p></td><td style="background: white;border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-left-style: none;border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding-bottom: 0;padding-left: 5.4pt;padding-right: 5.4pt;padding-top: 0;vertical-align: middle;width: 117.65pt;"><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 20.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">内容</span></p></td><td style="background: white;border-bottom: solid windowtext 